<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the DTB-Bobl-Future.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the DTB-Bobl-Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the DTB-Bobl-Future due June 1997, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS   STRIKE	ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A     105.0 PCT   1.04 DEM	0.57 PCT     101.38 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B     106.0 PCT   0.55 DEM	1.05 PCT     191.71 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT C	104.0 PCT   0.29 DEM	1.60 PCT     363.60 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	105.0 PCT   0.61 DEM	1.00 PCT     172.85 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.FEB.97-06.JUN.97   PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  105.44 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
